# The first routine to run on a machine: does the virtual pad reach the
# game, and which way does each axis act? V walks about 2.5 m to its right
# and 2.5 m ahead, then turns its view right and up and back.
#   the left stick does nothing -> the game does not read the pad (focus,
#                                  Steam Input, permissions): see the checklist
#   an axis is reversed         -> remembered for this run (an inverted camera)
limit 60
needs veh == 0
needs menu == 0
calibrate move
calibrate look
check savelock == 1
